    "title": "North's Conner Watson commits to UE - NewsBreak",
    "text": "EVANSVILLE, Ind. (WEHT) — North starting pitcher Connor Watson is staying in the Evansville area at the next level. Watson announced today that he committed to the University of Evansville. The Huskies’ ace was a flame thrower this season going a perfect 7-0 in the regular season with a sub one era and striking out 77 batters. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Eyewitness News (WEHT/WTVW).",
